<!-- SECTION: policies.How policies change -->
<section class="blk blk--cream" data-screen-label="How policies change">
  <div class="eyebrow">How a policy changes</div>
  <h2 class="u-107 sec">Version-controlled, in the open.</h2>
  <p class="u-108 lead">Every policy lives in the public record with its full history. Change one, and the reference number stays while the version increments — so you can always see what it said before, when it changed, and why. Sensitive sectors — healthcare, care, and child-facing education — are held to the highest bar and stay studies until consent, privacy, safeguarding, legal review, and human oversight are firmly in place.</p>
  <p class="u-41"><a href="https://github.com/uncost-org/uncost" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="u-btn u-btn--ink">See policy history on GitHub</a></p>
</section>
